<title>THAILAND: Quality Houses sees 390 mln net profit in 1996.</title>
<headline>Quality Houses sees 390 mln net profit in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Quality Houses expects to make a 1996 net profit of 390 million baht on a revenue of 3.70 billion baht, a senior company official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The property developer posted a net profit of 320 million baht on revenues of 2.99 bilion baht in 1995, the firm's assistant managing director Suwanna Wongsakulyong told Reuters.</p>
